@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### T01 View all issues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/issues

### T02 Create a valid issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer unavailable",
  "description": "The shared printer is not responding.",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### T05 Change issue status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/ISS-101/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### T07 Update an unknown issue
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/issues/does-not-exist/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}
